&_nc_ohc=OfxywT2K060Q7kNvwEVX-HI&_nc_oc=Ado9Ufot7xkqDZf8WrPLq_6-jqS9TqysOyNEUT17pijXx-9QZp9dhQ_eGZrxQ8sTPp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIWCXwx5MaYZr7YS3nqw9UvBT57F4iGCOHHznjPR_1LXA&oe=6AB66D03"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nwaaKScBbhgQ7kNvwEQTy_f&_nc_oc=Adra5zptUQbLNerWvmycNrr7py03HsqoFeukbuY2DKJt8QPFeb8_wxm0nrkfjHD4iYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ1Ljl1BPQV4-J-908KK7eCsWt8zo_K-mGKFj3g1HLDFA&oe=6AB69BCB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TuLB1Zog6wQQ7kNvwFurZe4&_nc_oc=AdpcVFE9HzGo2oAtpFHhr0hR_HeUsOC00v9Yh7RZ05MobWoYHExBVq_0hKy6sKSHJTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLe3_kzWpsutvcqDfEmVBYQ-EsgiX6kRdsbU0E4Qk-sUg&oe=6AB67A41"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oGyLeHvsjUwQ7kNvwFAPpt0&_nc_oc=AdqpfVpSbJI2Au-Ho60uTDYZxWfw6ey625CCtJ9dD_Uy4KIDUIbyuun1Ktxfzef7mks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJogGTVKywz5hp-zCnybVozV_NvbBvhfYIldWjissezcg&oe=6AB69384"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CGRTqtmAhsgQ7kNvwGutg_B&_nc_oc=AdqA9Xib7k42PhBkp0bsn-5G4YS8hsIZHbZ99WQlG40fBwA8x8ReI_ceRh6NExtH7PE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILJhLm41KIh6DrnqHvXuF7Otse59UWPCv0hKGHyPZmMQ&oe=6AB68741"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c0M3lOdwcXwQ7kNvwGXVJHf&_nc_oc=AdppjkFJMHiVG0OItY5HvVsev2t67PNZrdtdJx-3pTH14MI2nUs_FoIqxquB4aJxhjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7i_tLqCf2lspUDThOpZJaMaFXhgsR2F8SPeAqw6iDhg&oe=6AB67BE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EfP8SPZY8nUQ7kNvwGHHZ7t&_nc_oc=Adqv1ePVH3Vdv8xSeNYO24rsTxZsUjWqT0yubBX88XETuUBbJE5RGZrnQAAg7LuUnQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQINIpO-uGTrRZLtgw6TDnaMFjH0O-RcJwjUtZNzETM2nw&oe=6AB68224"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4z5qOvMTMaEQ7kNvwHWgNF0&_nc_oc=AdrgqsgNtJ5Hyp0tBX-kVLfq3O-0zus8nJgJnavRuSg45ek2JplIuvvIU3YkvJlNnCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK0_zEeCnbHOi4pcbm6VNL-FZPcNFNNSHsKSYqXLVPSyA&oe=6AB684FC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oOul9-sxNqgQ7kNvwEN